---
title: "positionTransfer (High Level Sale Customer Journey)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: position transfer requested
    q_check_caller --> q_legion_transfer: caller = legionOperator
    q_check_caller --> q_auth_transfer: caller has cryptographic authorization
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_legion_transfer --> q_check_timing: operator-initiated transfer
    q_auth_transfer --> q_verify_sig: transferInvestorPositionWithAuthorization
    q_verify_sig --> q_check_timing: signature valid
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid authorization signature
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_check_timing --> q_check_positions: block.timestamp > refundEndTime (for pre-liquid)
    q_check_timing --> q_revert_timing: transfer not yet allowed
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert TransferNotAllowed
    q_check_positions --> q_transfer_state: from position exists, to position empty
    q_check_positions --> q_revert_conflict: position conflict
    q_revert_conflict --> [*]: revert PositionConflict
    q_transfer_state --> q_update_from: copy position data to new investor
    q_update_from --> q_update_to: clear original investor position
    q_update_to --> [*]: emit PositionTransferred(from, to)

    note right of q_check_timing
        INV-001: Position transfers only allowed after refund period (pre-liquid)
        INV-002: Cryptographic authorization prevents unauthorized transfers
        INV-003: Used signature must be marked to prevent replay
        INV-004: Target address must not have existing position
    end note
